  <item>
    <title>EP29 互联网大厂35岁女性样本：稳住！搞钱！不退休！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6555d61a8fb8b597a284980e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6555d61a8fb8b597a284980e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Nov 2023 08:43:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>听众朋友们好！《恍然大悟》是十年产品经理然阿姨经营的一档泛职场播客。联系然阿姨微信pmPeiran，加入播客听友群，与嘉宾和听众互动交流。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>本期节目是然阿姨作为一枚35岁以上中国互联网女性劳动力样本，上半年接受剑桥人类学硕士朋友程千芸的访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们谈到了：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>然阿姨作为个体样本的11年互联网职业经历以及未来打算</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>中国互联网高薪和35岁现象</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>职场女性生育难题</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>工作的无意义感</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>怎么看待中年这个人生阶段</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为是访谈录音，音质有损，还请听众们多多包涵。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【传送门】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 然阿姨11年职业经历和未来打算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 互联网高薪现象的原因，以及祛魅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a> 高强度工作对生活的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> 高龄生育问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 怎么定义“中年”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2112">35:12</a> 工作的无意义感怎么消解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2497">41:37</a>东亚人紧凑的人生，遵循着一套规则生活，以及如何打破规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3167">52:47</a> 自称“然阿姨”是一种乐观的自嘲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3469">57:49</a> 中国的35岁现象有其原因</span></p><span></span><p><span>【一键加wx，拉你进入听友群】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6mxfXahAx47mtVRHXkrfVbPXX_.png"></figure>]]></description>
