  <item>
    <title>EP26 与毛老师畅聊读书习惯养成和读书带来的改变，以及书单推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ddf248e99bdef7d3fe455b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ddf248e99bdef7d3fe455b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Feb 2023 05:51:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>听众朋友们好！《恍然大悟》是十年产品经理然阿姨经营的一档泛职场播客。联系然阿姨微信pmPeiran，加入播客听友群，与嘉宾和听众互动交流。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>本期是然阿姨和毛老师年前连麦的直播回放（欢迎关注然阿姨视频号：然阿姨的产品课），</span><a href="https://b23.tv/WQAULYX" data-url="https://b23.tv/WQAULYX"><span>视频版本</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuWG5gNnSAtBFFZc0Izk9RDJewIX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>毛老师，大家可能不陌生，也是本频道的常客，是我的</span><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247486388&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=19d36f6eea4501f6de256c288391e72e&amp;chksm=ce0db9f4f97a30e2fe940d30b5058896d21008cc9b29be03869e40a5903d98b75343de42af1c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247486388&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=19d36f6eea4501f6de256c288391e72e&amp;chksm=ce0db9f4f97a30e2fe940d30b5058896d21008cc9b29be03869e40a5903d98b75343de42af1c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>前同事·朋友·人生是滚雪球帐号主理人</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/611931db629a774bd842e79e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/611931db629a774bd842e79e"><span>EP07：和毛老师聊聊普通人理财的一些错误观点</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/624c5a50d32de5100e5432f6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/624c5a50d32de5100e5432f6"><span>EP12：如何提升与他人建立连接的能力？来自毛老师的建议</span></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span>我和</span><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247486388&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=19d36f6eea4501f6de256c288391e72e&amp;chksm=ce0db9f4f97a30e2fe940d30b5058896d21008cc9b29be03869e40a5903d98b75343de42af1c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247486388&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=19d36f6eea4501f6de256c288391e72e&amp;chksm=ce0db9f4f97a30e2fe940d30b5058896d21008cc9b29be03869e40a5903d98b75343de42af1c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>毛老师</span></a><span>一起，谈论我们的读书习惯养成记。毛老师说他五岁起就开始读书，读书使他在小城生活中拥有了更大的视野。</span><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NzcxOTc4MA==&amp;mid=2648343108&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ae7a13a4ed08a43772337112b44bb13f&amp;chksm=befb99cf898c10d93d5b80232e68145018e67b59fc3d1573569b367917b138f04813674bc429&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NzcxOTc4MA==&amp;mid=2648343108&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ae7a13a4ed08a43772337112b44bb13f&amp;chksm=befb99cf898c10d93d5b80232e68145018e67b59fc3d1573569b367917b138f04813674bc429&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>我的阅读习惯养成，也离不开毛老师的鼓励，</span></a><span>起步虽晚但也终于养成习惯了，把读书从“应该的事”变成“喜欢的事”。我记得在刚毕业入职腾讯时，遇到很多工作和生活上的打击，毛老师比我早半年毕业，某次对接合作有幸认识了毛老师（也可能是毛老师主动联系我的？）闲谈间，毛老师给我推荐了一本李笑来的书《把时间当作朋友：运用心智获得解放》。虽然这本书讲了什么我已经几乎忘记，但当时是获得了一些精神力量的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>毛老师在我的朋友圈里一直是个读书多的存在，</span><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247486402&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6f239a3b625ebf904576c11709ce0a34&amp;chksm=ce0db982f97a309445a7426ed260d33babfc0154bb8b4eb6ad28b046e46788026bd9cb1adf47&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247486402&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6f239a3b625ebf904576c11709ce0a34&amp;chksm=ce0db982f97a309445a7426ed260d33babfc0154bb8b4eb6ad28b046e46788026bd9cb1adf47&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>今年他的年终</span></a><span>书单总结里推荐了好几本我之前不知道的书，甚至有台版书，可见涉猎非常广泛，而他之前</span><a href="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247484544&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5284c25280553fa6b5c9737ad1c077bd&amp;chksm=ce0db6c0f97a3fd6eb45394ee61efce9ceeaf14bef7e3b23f45776488a5b5e92d456f03f70da&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect" data-url="http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2MjEwMzM0Mw==&amp;mid=2247484544&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5284c25280553fa6b5c9737ad1c077bd&amp;chksm=ce0db6c0f97a3fd6eb45394ee61efce9ceeaf14bef7e3b23f45776488a5b5e92d456f03f70da&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect"><span>入坑墨水屏阅读器</span></a><span>之后也给我推荐了好几款，导致我中毒很深，目前为止也持有了好几款阅读器。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnWUliW7ZoQPzlZFVrks2Bs907LQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【传送门】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 毛老师是谁？嘉宾介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 然阿姨如何形成阅读习惯</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">07:53</a> 毛老师如何形成阅读习惯（从五岁开始？）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 然阿姨面试遇到“你最近在读什么书”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 职场领导要求大家必须读书？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> Q&amp;A 怎么应对出版书籍的删减</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 毛老师建议读《如何阅读一本书》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1585">26:25</a> 毛老师说日常读书时间分配</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 墨水屏阅读器大型安利现场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> 毛老师2022精选三本书推荐：</span></strong><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2915">48:35</a>《最高学习法》（台版）</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3250">54:10</a>《创造：用非传统方式做有价值的事》，Nest 创始人，在苹果打造了 iPod/iPhone 的大师托尼·法德尔写的书</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3462">57:42</a>《战斗细胞》Youtube知名博主的科普书</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3569">59:29</a> Q&amp;A 发散式阅读可取吗</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liKqkZ3dHnAtrU5foyQuNFOEmPjn.m4a" length="91140483" type="audio/mp4"/>
